2026-07-27T14:51:07.5629930Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:51:07.5631253Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
